          "input_ue_unconnectable": {}
        }
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Episode of Rick and Morty. 1st shot: There is a 40 year male Captain with a mustache and sunglasses lounging in the center cockpit of a 50ft ketch sailboat. The boat is moving along at 7 knots in a light breeze. (S1) [English] \"Smooth sailing today!\" the Captain says with a grin. 2nd shot: A green interdimensional gateway opens up on the starboard beam of the boat at deck level, about 6ft above the ocean surface. Camera holds on the boat as it sails past; the gateway stays fixed at the same point in frame relative to the horizon, growing smaller behind the boat as it moves away. Shot 3: Rick and Morty tumble out of the gateway in mid-air, too late to land on the boat, their arms and legs already flailing as they immediately plunge downward toward the ocean below with no surface to land on. (S2) [English] \"Aw geez, we missed it!\" Morty yelps mid-fall, and they hit the water with a splash and vanish beneath the surface, while the boat sails on and the captain waves.",
        1344,
        768,
        362
      ]
    },
