          "input_ue_unconnectable": {}
        }
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Jason's MiniMax H3 - Image to Video (fl2va)\n\n**first_frame / last_frame are both optional** - leave either disconnected for pure text+audio-to-video, or wire one/both for image-to-video / first-last-frame continuation.\n\nDuration snaps to 17k+5 frames @ 24fps automatically. Trained range is ~124-362 frames (~5-15s); longer is untested.\n\nSampler is `res_multistep` + `beta` per the model card - don't swap to `simple`, it underperforms here.\n\n"
      ],
